# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, call [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") on the boxed circuit to construct a template and samplex pair. You will see how each of the boxes is turned into a barrier “sandwich” that includes `rz-sx-rz-sx-rz` fragments to implement dressing.\n"
msgstr "Seterusnya, panggil [`build()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/build#samplomatic.build \"samplomatic.build\") pada litar ber-box untuk membina pasangan templat dan samplex. Anda akan melihat bagaimana setiap box ditukar menjadi “sandwic” barrier yang merangkumi serpihan `rz-sx-rz-sx-rz` untuk melaksanakan dressing.\n"

