#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "All of the sampling nodes (stars) are responsible for generating randomizations for twirling, sampling from noise models, or injecting basis changes.\n"
msgstr "Semua nod pensampelan (bintang) bertanggungjawab menjana perawakan untuk twirling, mengambil sampel daripada model hingar, atau menyuntik pengubahan basis.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
